120 cases, 5 runs of the same system

  score by run      92%  92%  91%  95%  92%
  range             91% to 95%
  cases that gave a different verdict in at least one run: 10
    by kind: document 6, unanswerable 4

where the uncertainty in one run's score comes from
  which cases were chosen (binomial, n = 120)        ± 2.4%
  the system answering differently (sd across runs)  ± 1.6%

three ways to summarise the runs
  pass@1  (average share correct per run)          92%
  pass@5  (correct in at least one run)            95%
  pass^5  (correct in every run)                   87%
